<p local-id=3D"56744af43a48">Current-state summary:</p>
<p local-id=3D"430d22760301">ActiveWest currently manages operational infor=
mation through spreadsheets, shared drives, email, paper forms and separate=
 online tools. Information is distributed across different locations and pr=
ocesses, requiring staff and volunteers to locate, verify and combine recor=
ds when completing administrative and reporting activities.</p>
